      "id": "mathematics-05-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If (a/b) = (3/4), what is the value of (5a + 2b) / (5a - 2b)?",
      "options": {
        "A": "23/7",
        "B": "7/23",
        "C": "1",
        "D": "0"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Putting a=3, b=4: (15 + 8) / (15 - 8) = 23 / 7",
      "hash": "26eb49c0ebc86fab",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि (a/b) = (3/4) है, तो (5a + 2b) / (5a - 2b) का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "23/7",
            "B": "7/23",
            "C": "1",
            "D": "0"
          },
          "explanation": "a=3, b=4 रखने पर: (15 + 8) / (15 - 8) = 23 / 7"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "The ratio of girls to boys in a class is 4:5. If the number of boys is 25, what is the number of girls?",
      "options": {
        "A": "15",
        "B": "20",
        "C": "24",
        "D": "30"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "5 units = 25, so 1 unit = 5. Number of girls = 4 × 5 = 20",
      "hash": "03d9d1a3612b4828",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक कक्षा में लड़कियों और लड़कों का अनुपात 4:5 है। यदि लड़कों की संख्या 25 है, तो लड़कियों की संख्या क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "15",
            "B": "20",
            "C": "24",
            "D": "30"
          },
          "explanation": "5 इकाई = 25, तो 1 इकाई = 5। लड़कियों की संख्या = 4 × 5 = 20"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The length of a rectangle is increased by 20% and breadth is decreased by 20%. What is the effect on the area?",
      "options": {
        "A": "No change",
        "B": "4% increase",
        "C": "4% decrease",
        "D": "10% decrease"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Formula: x - y - (xy/100) = 20 - 20 - (400/100) = -4%. So, 4% decrease.",
      "hash": "0ed9147d2016f2e9",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक आयत की लंबाई 20% बढ़ा दी जाती है और चौड़ाई 20% घटा दी जाती है। क्षेत्रफल पर क्या प्रभाव पड़ेगा?",
          "options": {
            "A": "कोई बदलाव नहीं",
            "B": "4% वृद्धि",
            "C": "4% कमी",
            "D": "10% कमी"
          },
          "explanation": "सूत्र: x - y - (xy/100) = 20 - 20 - (400/100) = -4%. अतः 4% की कमी।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-05-004",
